<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Mary Borji - Letter of Authority</title>
  <style>
    body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#111827;line-height:1.55;margin:42px;font-size:14px}
    h1{color:#0052a4;font-size:24px} .box{border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:14px;margin:16px 0}
    table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0}td{border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:9px;vertical-align:top}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Letter of Authority</h1>
  <p><strong>Client:</strong> Mrs Mary Borji<br>
  <strong>Address:</strong> 11 Richland Road, Liverpool, L13 7BN<br>
  <strong>Telephone:</strong> 447817717776<br>
  <strong>Email:</strong> marycborji@gmail.com</p>

  <p>I, Mrs Mary Borji, authorise Quaerens and/or its appointed representatives to contact relevant parties and request information, documents and responses in relation to the spray foam loft insulation installed at my property.</p>

  <p>This authority relates to the installation carried out on or around 18/02/2021, the Green Homes Scheme / grant voucher funding route, and subsequent roof damage, humidity, timber deterioration and roof replacement issues.</p>

  <p>The parties who may be contacted include, but are not limited to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Protect Insulation Services Ltd.</li>
    <li>Green Homes Scheme administrators or connected scheme parties.</li>
    <li>Warranty, guarantee or insurance-backed guarantee providers.</li>
    <li>Roofing contractors, surveyors or inspection companies.</li>
    <li>Any relevant finance, payment, complaint or regulatory body where applicable.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="box">
    I authorise the release of documents, account information, contract details, survey notes, installation records, warranty records, complaint responses, photographs and payment information reasonably required to assess or progress this matter.
  </div>

  <p>I understand that this authority does not guarantee recovery and does not replace formal legal advice. Where legal work or regulated claims management is required, the matter may need to be reviewed by an authorised legal or claims management partner.</p>

  <table>
    <tr><td><strong>Client signature</strong><br><br><br></td><td><strong>Date</strong><br><br><br></td></tr>
    <tr><td colspan="2"><strong>Printed name:</strong> Mrs Mary Borji</td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
